{
  "title": "【相談】うちの玄関だけ毎晩『おかえり』って聞こえるんだが",
  "body": "<div class=\"neko-thread\" style=\"font-family:Meiryo,'MS PGothic',sans-serif;font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;color:#222;\"><div class=\"neko-res-list\"><div class=\"res\" id=\"res1\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">1：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 19:08:11 ID:Aq7mK2pR</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">一人暮らしなんだが、夜帰宅して玄関を開けると小さい声で「おかえり」って聞こえる。<br>昨日で三日連続。<br>誰もいないし、正直ちょっと怖い。</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res2\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">2：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 19:11:28 ID:Bv4nT8xQ</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">おかえり</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res3\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">3：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 19:14:45 ID:Ck9rP1sD</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">ただいま</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res4\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">4：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 19:17:02 ID:De3wL6zM</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">解決したな</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res5\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">5：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 19:20:19 ID:Ef8qN2aV</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">いや待て。声は男？女？</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res6\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">6：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 19:24:36 ID:Aq7mK2pR</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">女っぽい。子供みたいな声。<br>靴脱いでる間に一回だけ聞こえる。</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res7\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">7：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 19:28:53 ID:Gh2yB5uJ</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">隣の部屋のテレビじゃないのか</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res8\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">8：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 19:31:10 ID:Hj6dF9cW</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">壁薄いアパートなら普通にありそう</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res9\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">9：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 19:35:27 ID:Ik1pS4eX</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">玄関の外から？ 中から？</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res10\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">10：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 19:39:44 ID:Aq7mK2pR</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\"><a href=\"#res9\" style=\"color:#3467a2;text-decoration:underline;\">&gt;&gt;9</a><br>中から聞こえる気がする。<br>でも電気つけると誰もいない。</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res11\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">11：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 19:43:01 ID:Lm5vC8tH</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">座敷童子なら家賃半分払ってもらえ</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res12\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">12：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 19:48:18 ID:Bv4nT8xQ</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">何で半分なんだよ</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res13\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">13：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 19:52:35 ID:No7aR3kP</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">帰宅時間は毎日同じ？</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res14\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">14：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 19:56:52 ID:Aq7mK2pR</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">だいたい夜九時くらい。<br>昨日は十時過ぎだった。</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res15\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">15：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 20:01:09 ID:Pq2fU6nZ</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">声の録音できんのか</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res16\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">16：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 20:06:26 ID:Aq7mK2pR</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">テープレコーダー持ってない。<br>携帯の録音機能で試せるか調べる。</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res17\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">17：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 20:11:43 ID:Rs8jE1wK</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">まず玄関のどこから聞こえるか確認しろ</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res18\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">18：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 20:16:00 ID:Tu4cM7yB</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">夜に知らない声がする部屋へ毎日帰るのもすごいな</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res19\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">19：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 20:21:17 ID:Vw9hD2qF</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">いや実家帰れよ</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res20\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">20：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 20:26:34 ID:Aq7mK2pR</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">引っ越してまだ一ヶ月なんだよ。<br>敷金礼金払ったばかりだし。</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res21\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">21：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 20:31:51 ID:Xy3kG6rN</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">前の住人が残した何かとか</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res22\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">22：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 20:36:08 ID:Zb5nJ8sL</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">何かって何だよ</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res23\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">23：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 20:42:25 ID:Cd7pQ1vT</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">しゃべる下駄箱</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res24\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">24：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 20:48:42 ID:Ef8qN2aV</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">欲しいような欲しくないような</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res25\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">25：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 20:53:59 ID:Aq7mK2pR</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">今夜は帰ったらすぐ報告する。<br>携帯で録音できるか試す。</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res26\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">26：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 21:13:16 ID:Gh2yB5uJ</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">玄関で「ただいま」って言ってみろ</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res27\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">27：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 21:20:33 ID:Hj6dF9cW</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">返事が「お疲れ様」になったらどうする</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res28\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">28：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 21:27:50 ID:Ik1pS4eX</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">礼儀正しい幽霊だな</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res29\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">29：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 21:34:07 ID:Lm5vC8tH</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">ちなみに玄関に何置いてる？</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res30\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">30：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 21:41:24 ID:Aq7mK2pR</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">靴箱と傘立てと、親がくれた変な置物。<br>あと郵便物。</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res31\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">31：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 21:48:41 ID:No7aR3kP</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">変な置物を詳しく</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res32\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">32：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 21:55:58 ID:Aq7mK2pR</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">木彫りのフクロウ。<br>目が妙にでかい。</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res33\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">33：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 22:02:15 ID:Pq2fU6nZ</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">犯人フクロウ</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res34\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">34：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 22:09:32 ID:Rs8jE1wK</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">フクロウに謝れ</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res35\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">35：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 22:16:49 ID:Tu4cM7yB</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">その置物に電池入ってないか？</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res36\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">36：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 22:23:06 ID:Aq7mK2pR</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">木製で電池入れる場所なんかないと思う。<br>帰ったら見てみる。</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res37\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">37：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 22:30:23 ID:Vw9hD2qF</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">昔の土産物にはしゃべるやつあるぞ</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res38\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">38：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 22:37:40 ID:Xy3kG6rN</div><div class=\"body\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:3px 0 0 20px!important;\">あったな。手を叩くと反応するやつ</div></div>\n<div class=\"res\" id=\"res39\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;margin:0 0 16px!important;\"><div class=\"meta\" style=\"font-size:16px!important;line-height:1.45!important;\">39：<span style=\"color:green;font-weight:bold;\">名無しさん＠お腹いっぱい。</span> 2004/10/16(土) 22:44:57 ID:Zb5nJ8sL</div><div class=\"body\